diff -bruNX ignore.txt ..\official/changes ./changes
--- ..\official/changes	Thu Jan  1 00:00:00 1970
+++ ./changes	Wed Aug 24 14:17:58 2005
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+Changes to the section 9.4.  Customization options in NetHack Guidebook
+
+
+Add the following:
+
+---
+confirm_untrap
+  Have the game confirm if you want to search for traps on a lone container
+  on floor where no floor trap exist. (default on).
+---
+
